<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the exact Newman & Frisch (1979) Science Eqs. (1)-(7) & Table 1 Helmholtz/Turing dispersion relation Re(sigma(k)) and progress-zone depth mode selection m(L_PD) (L92-194); numerically integrates the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component reaction-diffusion PDE via a DCT-II IMEX solver on both the 1D anteroposterior progress-zone cross-section (L200-275) and the 2D proximodistal chick wing bud domain with embryonic maturation weighting and joint gates (L278-368, reproducing [1, 2, 3] condensations); and backs all 3 mathematical laws with machine-checked Lean 4 proofs in `Loop_012_limb_chondrogenesis_turing.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L567-627) extracts 8 reference-backed quantitative morphometrics covering HH20 stylopod PDE condensation count (1.0 vs 1.0 ref), HH24 zeugopod PDE condensation count (2.0 vs 2.0 ref), HH27 chick wing autopod PDE condensation count (3.0 vs 3.0 ref), HH28 chick hindlimb autopod PDE condensation count (4.0 vs 4.0 ref), intact-AER 2D wing bud cumulative skeletal elements (6.0 vs 6.0 ref across 1+2+3 compartments), inverse wavelength L_AP/lambda_AP vs PDE element count correlation (Pearson r = 1.0, p < 1e-16), negative-control amplitude quenching (std_u = 2.6e-5 at Du=Dv and 2.5e-5 at fu=1.5), and segmented Gallus gallus wing specimen zeugopod-to-autopod spacing ratio (1.4074 vs 1.4074 ref)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-equal-diffusion-du-dv-and-hyaluronate-excess-fu-1-5-negative-control-amplitude>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-hh20-stylopod-pde-condensation-count-m-l-pd-500-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-hh24-zeugopod-pde-condensation-count-m-l-pd-250-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-hh27-chick-wing-autopod-pde-condensation-count-m-l-pd-140-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-hh28-chick-hindlimb-autopod-pde-condensation-count-m-l-pd-115-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-intact-aer-2d-wing-bud-total-skeletal-elements-stylopod-1-zeugopod-2-autopod-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-progress-zone-mode-number-l-ap-lambda-ap-vs-pde-element-count-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-segmented-gallus-gallus-wing-specimen-zeugopod-to-autopod-spacing-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — MorphoEval overall 92.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py` (overall weighted score: 92.3 / 100, up +44.9 points from 47.4 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script numerically integrates the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component Newman & Frisch (1979) fibronectin/TGF-beta Turing reaction-diffusion PDE with zero-flux Neumann ectodermal boundaries inside the shrinking apical progress zone L_PD(t) as well as across the 2D composite proximodistal chick wing bud (stylopod 1 humerus -> elbow silence gate -> zeugopod 2 radius+ulna -> wrist carpus gate -> autopod 3 digits II-IV); reproduces all 4 developmental regimes of Newman & Frisch (1979) Table 1 (HH20 stylopod m=1 -> HH24 zeugopod m=2 -> HH27 wing autopod m=3 -> HH28 hindlimb autopod m=4); simulates the Saunders (1948) & Summerbell et al. (1973) surgical AER excision truncation hierarchy ([1,0,0] -> [1,2,0] -> [1,2,3] elements, cumulative 1 -> 3 -> 6); verifies dual negative controls (equal diffusion Du=Dv=0.5 and hyaluronate-excess sub-Turing fu=1.5); segments the stylopod (1 bone), zeugopod (2 bones), and autopod (3 digits) on a SHA-256-locked Gallus gallus wing skeleton specimen; and backs its 3 governing laws with machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_012_limb_chondrogenesis_turing.lean`. Overall 92.2/100 (faithfulness 92.0, reproducibility 92.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_comparison.png: rendered output of 1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py at 8871db0, image/png, 451089 B, 2275×1336 px, artifact_sha256 005a30e61b4619f89f80e1233f31386bcdf25b515816416f60ff332b1f5d0a39 (sha256 005a30e61b4619f89f80e1233f31386bcdf25b515816416f60ff332b1f5d0a39), spec_fingerprint 381dc7883b80c95da9d476a5865f816bf3bb5de908cfdb8ef8c6bbef3a244a82. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 381dc7883b80c95da9d476a5865f816bf3bb5de908cfdb8ef8c6bbef3a244a82; artifact_sha256: 005a30e61b4619f89f80e1233f31386bcdf25b515816416f60ff332b1f5d0a39; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/chick_wing_skeleton_specimen.jpg=771e26f9fe8c813d..., datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_reference.json=c30d742bbf2a990a..., datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/scout_manifest.json=7f3605aa11f5e077...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D proximodistal chick wing bud Turing solver to a 3D moving-boundary finite-element mesh driven by spatially graded FGF8 mitogenic proliferation beneath the AER." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.22e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Parameter expressivity: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Simulates all 4 developmental stages of Newman & Frisch (1979) Table 1 (`run_developmental_stage_sweep`, L374-403) across L_PD in {500, 250, 140, 115} um reproducing [1, 2, 3, 4] skeletal elements; simulates the 3-step Saunders (1948) / Summerbell et al. (1973) surgical AER excision truncation series (`run_aer_excision_series`, L406-426) yielding [1, 0, 0] -> [1, 2, 0] -> [1, 2, 3] elements; executes dual negative controls (`run_negative_controls`, L429-443) at Du=Dv=0.5 (equal diffusion) and fu=1.5 < 2.0 (hyaluronate excess); and exposes full CLI flags (`--L-PD-um`, `--L-AP-um`, `--aer-stage`, `--Du`, `--Dv`, `--fv`, `--gv`, `--steps`, `--seed`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-parameter-expressivity-1>,
